 234: /**
 235:  * An organisation's name, trimmed, or a refusal naming why â€” the SAME rule `validateCompleteSignup`
 236:  * applies to the name arriving on an NGO signup, stated once.
 237:  *
 238:  * WHY IT IS HERE AND NOT AT ITS TWO CALL SITES, because that is where it used to be. The rule was
 239:  * written twice â€” once in `create-organization/index.ts`, a file no type-checker covers, and once
