 252: /* ---------------------------------------------------------------- 3. may this account do NGO work */
 253: 
 254: /**
 255:  * AT-001.06, as a decision: an NGO-only action is permitted to an `ngo` account and to nothing else.
 256:  *
 257:  * A `platform_admin` is refused here too, and that is a deliberate reading of the criterion rather
 258:  * than an accident of the implementation. AT-001.06's clause is "one account holds exactly one
 259:  * global type; the NGO path requires a separate account", and creating an organisation as an NGO is
