 206:       // Clause two: "the GitHub identity is linked to it". The link lives in Supabase Auth, which
 207:       // this leaf does not own; what it CAN observe â€” and what makes the link consequential rather
 208:       // than merely asserted â€” is that the account's own row carries the handle that was linked. A
 209:       // signup that accepted a GitHub session and recorded nothing about the identity would fail
 210:       // here while passing clause one.
